  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0494.ayge.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0494.ayge.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0494.ayge.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0494_ayge"><head>ΑΥΓΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="kock-0494-ayge-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0494_ayge">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0494-ayge-3-l1" xml:lang="grc">καὶ δὴ δεδειπνήκασιν αἱ γυναῖκες· ἀλλ’ ἀφαιρεῖν</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0494-ayge-3-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὥρα ’στὶν ἤδη τὰς τραπέζας, εἶτα παρακορῆσαι,</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="kock-0494-ayge-3-l3" xml:lang="grc">ἔπειτα κατὰ χειρῶν ἑκάστῃ καὶ μύρον τι δοῦναι.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 9, 408 e Φιλύλλιος δ’ ἐν Αὔγῃ κατὰ χειρῶν (ὕδωρ) εἴρηκεν οὕτως κτλ.</note>
